{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"柏拉图·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"plato","categoryLabel":"柏拉图","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":2.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/21_plato/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"柏拉图-核心贡献\">柏拉图·核心贡献</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦柏拉图（约公元前428/427—前348/347年）&quot;留给西方的几样东西&quot;——那些独立于他生平、至今仍在塑造哲学、政治与教育的<strong>学说与制度成果</strong>。它回答的是&quot;柏拉图贡献了什么&quot;，而非&quot;柏拉图是谁&quot;或&quot;他的思想如何被后人评价&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>本 hub（核心贡献）</strong>：三大支柱——理念论（含洞穴之喻）、《理想国》的政治与伦理（正义与灵魂、哲学王）、学园与教育（第一所大学、辩证法与教育）。重点是&quot;成果本身&quot;的内容、论证与影响。</li>\n<li><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：<ul>\n<li>生平背景（家世、苏格拉底之死、三赴西西里）见 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>。</li>\n<li>哲学方法与跨主题观念（如对话体、回忆说、厄洛斯）见 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。</li>\n<li>具体对话篇目（《会饮》《斐多》《蒂迈欧》等）的逐部导读见 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>。</li>\n<li>对后世（新柏拉图主义、基督教、文艺复兴）的影响史见 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>。</li>\n<li>围绕哲学王、艺术批判等的批评与争议见 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 与上述各 hub 难免有交集（如哲学王既是&quot;贡献&quot;又有&quot;争议&quot;），我们的原则是：<strong>同一事实只在主篇深展开，其余以相对路径交叉链接</strong>——哲学王的内容在此展开，对其极权之嫌的系统评判则归 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>理念论是其余一切的地基，建议按下图顺序阅读：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;1-1 理念的世界&lt;br/&gt;本体论地基&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1-2 洞穴之喻&lt;br/&gt;知识论·教育的戏剧化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;2-1 正义与灵魂&lt;br/&gt;城邦-灵魂同构&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;2-2 哲学王&lt;br/&gt;政治理想之顶点&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;3-2 辩证法与教育&lt;br/&gt;如何培养哲学王&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;3-1 第一所大学&lt;br/&gt;承载教育的机构&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"1-1 理念的世界&lt;br/&gt;本体论地基\"] --&gt; B[\"1-2 洞穴之喻&lt;br/&gt;知识论·教育的戏剧化\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"2-1 正义与灵魂&lt;br/&gt;城邦-灵魂同构\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"2-2 哲学王&lt;br/&gt;政治理想之顶点\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"3-2 辩证法与教育&lt;br/&gt;如何培养哲学王\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"3-1 第一所大学&lt;br/&gt;承载教育的机构\"]</pre><p><strong>前置知识</strong>：无须哲学专业背景，但若先了解苏格拉底的诘问法（见 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>）与前苏格拉底的流变/存在之争，会更顺畅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节地图\">章节地图</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>篇</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 理念论</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-theory-of-forms/the-world-of-forms\">理念的世界</a></td>\n<td>两个世界、分有难题</td>\n<td>真正的存在是永恒的理念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 理念论</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-theory-of-forms/the-allegory-of-the-cave\">洞穴之喻</a></td>\n<td>上升与返回、转向说</td>\n<td>哲学是走出洞穴又重返洞穴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 理想国</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-republic/justice-and-the-soul\">正义与灵魂</a></td>\n<td>三阶层、灵魂三分</td>\n<td>正义是灵魂各部分的和谐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 理想国</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-republic/the-philosopher-king\">哲学王</a></td>\n<td>智慧与权力合一</td>\n<td>认识善者方可治国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 学园</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-academy/the-first-university\">第一所大学</a></td>\n<td>组织化学术共同体</td>\n<td>知识第一次有了机构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 学园</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-academy/dialectic-and-education\">辩证法与教育</a></td>\n<td>转向说、上升课程</td>\n<td>教育是引导灵魂转向光明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读完本 hub，你将理解柏拉图如何用一套&quot;理念—灵魂—城邦—教育&quot;环环相扣的体系，为西方的形而上学、政治哲学与高等教育同时奠基。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-theory-of-forms","title":"The Theory Of Forms","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-world-of-forms","title":"理念的世界","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms/the-world-of-forms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-allegory-of-the-cave","title":"洞穴之喻","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms/the-allegory-of-the-cave"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-republic","title":"The Republic","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"justice-and-the-soul","title":"正义与灵魂","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic/justice-and-the-soul"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-philosopher-king","title":"哲学王","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic/the-philosopher-king"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-academy","title":"The Academy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-academy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-first-university","title":"第一所大学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-academy/the-first-university"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialectic-and-education","title":"辩证法与教育","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-academy/dialectic-and-education"}]}]}